config APP_SPORT
    bool "Sport activity apps (Run, Walk, Bike)"
    help
      Garmin-style Run, Walk and Bike apps on the watch's own sensors:
      GNSS through the location service (CONFIG_SERVICE_LOCATION) when
      the board has it, heart rate, barometer and steps. Activities are
      recorded to the filesystem and exported as FIT files.

if APP_SPORT

config APP_SPORT_FLUSH_S
    int "Seconds of samples buffered"
    default 10
    range 1 27
    help
      Samples are written to the filesystem this often; events at
      once, and whatever is buffered at an orderly restart or
      power-off. A fault, a watchdog reset or a sudden power loss
      loses at most this much.

config APP_SPORT_MAX_ACTIVITIES
    int "Activities kept"
    default 30
    range 2 60
    help
      The oldest are deleted when a new one starts past this many, or
      when the filesystem runs short.

config APP_SPORT_FREE_RESERVE_KIB
    int "Filesystem space left free (KiB)"
    default 1024
    help
      Free space a new segment of an activity leaves in the
      filesystem; older activities are deleted to keep it, and the
      recording ends if that is not enough.

config APP_SPORT_SHELL
    bool "Shell commands"
    default y
    depends on SHELL
    help
      The workout shell command: list the activities, export them as
      FIT files (tools/una/workouts.py), delete them.

endif
